  "goodToKnow": "Die Geschäftsordnung is the rules of procedure or standing orders of a parliament, council or company board. The Bundestag has its own Geschäftsordnung governing speaking time, votes and committees. In meetings, a Antrag zur Geschäftsordnung (raised by lifting both hands) is a point of order and takes priority over speeches. A club's founding rules are die Satzung. Plural: die Geschäftsordnungen."
